if(($argv[1]??'')==='--html'){foreach([['index',''],['baocao','tiendo'],['activities','online'],['giaovien',''],['them',''],['ketqua','']]as[$page,$tab]){$r=render_menu($page,$tab);file_put_contents('/tmp/cm-menu-'.$page.'.html','<!doctype html><html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://menu.test/bootstrap.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://menu.test/global.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://menu.test/unified.css"><script defer src="https://menu.test/bootstrap.js"></script><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:16px system-ui}</style></head><body class="cm-body">'.$r['html'].'<main class="container">Fixture content</main></body></html>');}}
